        {
          "id": "26ea50f6-ffc0-49cf-8376-8e9f29b94621",
          "name": "Send Email",
          "request": {
            "name": "Send Email",
            "description": {
              "content": "API to send an email message using a template.\n\nGuardian invokes this API to send emails, typically for OTP delivery or other notifications.\n\nThe request body includes:\n- **channel**: Communication channel (always \"email\" for this endpoint)\n- **to**: Recipient email address\n- **templateName**: Name of the email template to use\n- **templateParams**: Template parameters as a JSON object (e.g., {\"otp\": \"123456\"})\n\nThe communication service is responsible for:\n- Rendering the template with the provided parameters\n- Sending the email to the recipient\n- Handling email delivery failures gracefully\n\n**Response**: Returns status code 200 on successful email queuing/sending. Any response other than status code 200 will be considered a failure by Guardian.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "sendEmail"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": null,
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"channel\": \"<string>\",\n  \"to\": \"<string>\",\n  \"templateName\": \"<string>\",\n  \"templateParams\": {\n    \"key_0\": 771.1336124041923\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
